00:33:26.737 --> 00:33:31.497
It's not just recording, but we'll actually fix things for you.

00:33:31.497 --> 00:33:36.857
Flight recorder, we can't fix what happened on the flight path because it's one and done.

00:33:36.857 --> 00:33:41.777
But in the reality of as you're looking at tracing and end to end, we can say, you don't

00:33:41.777 --> 00:33:42.777
need to do this.

00:33:42.777 --> 00:33:43.936
You can fix this the next time.

00:33:43.936 --> 00:33:47.936
The actionability and remediation is what we also do.

00:33:47.936 --> 00:33:48.936
Observing is interesting.

00:33:48.936 --> 00:33:50.977
Frankly, it's glorified monitoring.

00:33:50.977 --> 00:33:57.776
It's now making it actionable and remediating is where the industry is now heading towards.

