So you should see on the confidence level the agent has and then match it to the risk.

00:34:44.337 --> 00:34:49.257
So the goal isn't to keep a human in the loop, it is to make sure the human is a step away

00:34:49.257 --> 00:34:50.737
from the loop where it matters.

