00:40:21.296 --> 00:40:25.976
to then, like, load that into their brain and understand what's going on.

00:40:25.976 --> 00:40:30.057
And then if you're just presenting it to them and saying, you know, review for correctness

00:40:30.057 --> 00:40:35.497
or review for risk, I don't know that, like, they're going to do that, because it's a difficult

00:40:35.497 --> 00:40:36.497
task.

