00:42:34.856 --> 00:42:42.497
use? I think that's one word, governance, you have to have a control tower, which

00:42:42.497 --> 00:42:45.497
actually sees what each agent is doing.

00:42:46.017 --> 00:42:51.577
You should not only have a command line view, you should actually have a diagrammatical

