access to this data from this database, or it went ahead and interacted with another

00:43:03.096 --> 00:43:09.057
specialized agent, it together, they went ahead and did this, you need to have a top

00:43:09.057 --> 00:43:13.937
down view. And it should be, you should be able to go zoom it further and further.

00:43:14.456 --> 00:43:20.937
So having a traceable and auditable path is really important and having a control tower

00:43:20.937 --> 00:43:26.536
of agents. So you can, you know, you can have a software that's whose core job is to

00:43:26.536 --> 00:43:28.416
just monitor what agents are doing.

